# Content quality

- Tool pages need unique explanatory content (formula, worked example, tables, FAQ, sources)—not widget-only.
- Prefer extension services and manufacturer specs over anonymous blogs.
- AI-assisted drafting must be fact-checked; no mass near-duplicate pages.
- Keep brand voice practical and neutral; estimates disclaimer where relevant.
- Link related tools/guides with descriptive anchors.
